The '''Supervisor's Tower''' was a structure in the center of a [[Unidentified city (At Attin)|city]] on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="This Could Be a Real Adventure" /> [[The Supervisor]] was located in the tower and controlled both the entire planet's power supply and security systems.<ref name="The Real Good Guys">{{SkeletonCrew|The Real Good Guys}}</ref>

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Supervisor's Tower first appeared yet unidentified in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]]"<ref name="This Could Be a Real Adventure" /> the first episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref> It was later identified as the Supervisor's Tower in "[[Can't Say I Remember No At Attin]]," the fourth episode of the series.<ref name="No At Attin">{{SkeletonCrew|Can't Say I Remember No At Attin}}</ref>

